The Church of the Thirteenth Realm is based in [[Geography/Althane/Lunae Badlands/Hidden Gulch/Haven/index|Haven]], and is lead by [[People/Althane/Ezekiel Grimm|Reverend Grimm]]. They preach about a paradise granted to them by a hidden realm, [[Geography/Althane/The Thirteenth Realm|the Thirteenth Realm]], that once orbited [[Geography/Althane/index|Althane]] and [[Geography/Althane/Realms/Ilkyne|Ilkyne]]. The realm fell and broke at the end of the Deep's work, and Ilkyne is gone.

The ministers and law enforcement of the church are called Guardian Angels. All angels appear to be [[Bestiary/Realmtouched#Aasimar|Aasimar]], with halos or wings betraying their station from a distance. Curiously, the angels are able to cast spells without developing the telltale spellrings in their eyes.
